Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Make the editor only update what actually relates to
 changed project settings

---
 editor/editor_node.cpp | 451 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 340 insertions(+), 111 deletions(-)

diff --git a/editor/editor_node.cpp b/editor/editor_node.cpp
index b2174f13..f88125ef 100644
